    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688222266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11700,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688226866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. To pull up your account, could I please get your name and order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688228866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Peterson. Order 94-Alpha-725.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11700,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688235933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. I see your recent order for the Velocity Racing Jersey. To make sure I understand the situation correctly, what specifically is the issue with the item?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688238399998
    },
    {
      "text": "It doesn't fit.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11700,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688249866664
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, thank you for clarifying. Is it a technical fault with the garment or more of a sizing preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688251066664
    },
    {
      "text": "Obviously it's the wrong size. The jersey is just way too tight. It's not complicated.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11700,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688258199997
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand completely. No problem at all. I see here that the item was delivered just six days ago, so you are unfortunately outside our 10-day policy for an exchange or return. Would you prefer a refund, or would you like me to process an exchange for a different size?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688264133330
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. An exchange, I guess. It's less hassle.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11700,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688281799996
    },
    {
      "text": "Excellent. I can set that up for you right now. I see you ordered a Medium. What size would you like instead?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688284999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Large.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 11700,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768688292466662
    },
    {
